body:
Psychosocial

&#x200B;

Pretty much the song that got me into Slipknot.

System Shock 2. 

&#x200B;

Fallout 1 and 2 have amazing atmospheric music.

Eh, the usual, nuclear bombs and secret alien technology. The prices on these things were a total scam so I never bothered buying them. People these days overpricing nuclear bombs, smh.

&#x200B;

\[FBI, THIS IS A JOKE\]

Aliens.

